{"v":1,"id":"5df8f41baad0","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"You will never know the stone cold grave,","s":33.91,"e":36.86},{"t":"nor hang from a criminal’s tree.","s":36.94,"e":42.43},{"t":"Never taste that severed breath","s":42.5,"e":45.24},{"t":"when heaven seemed far from Me.","s":45.32,"e":50.82},{"t":"You will never sweat out drops of blood","s":50.9,"e":54.02},{"t":"in a garden pressed alone.","s":54.1,"e":55.73},{"t":"Never hear brutes haggle your garments.","s":55.77,"e":62.62},{"t":"Hung bare, stripped down to bone.","s":62.68,"e":67.66},{"t":"As they pierced My side and lifted Me high,","s":67.74,"e":72.46},{"t":"arms opened wide between earth and sky…","s":72.56,"e":76.16},{"t":"I was brought down low in My passion.","s":76.28,"e":79.59},{"t":"I bore that hour to make you Mine.","s":79.71,"e":83.91},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":83.93,"e":86.04},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":86.14,"e":88.09},{"t":"Love does not turn away.","s":88.16,"e":92.42},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":92.53,"e":94.49},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":94.6,"e":96.58},{"t":"I bore the price that day.","s":96.7,"e":101.52},{"t":"I hope you never feel what I feel","s":101.54,"e":104.52},{"t":"when the earth is filled with violence.","s":104.56,"e":110.41},{"t":"When rivers of tears and blood run dry","s":110.47,"e":114.1},{"t":"and heaven answers silence.","s":114.2,"e":116.78},{"t":"My heart is very heavy.","s":116.84,"e":122.67},{"t":"I take no pleasure at all.","s":122.79,"e":126.89},{"t":"As My hand draws back in anger,","s":126.99,"e":130.55},{"t":"Tears continue to fall.","s":130.64,"e":135.88},{"t":"My blood runs down - and they refuse it.","s":135.96,"e":139.49},{"t":"My tears fall like rain - yet they turn away.","s":139.6,"e":143.79},{"t":"They heap up death with willing hands.","s":143.89,"e":147.89},{"t":"Still they choose it.","s":147.93,"e":150.99},{"t":"They choose death.","s":151.02,"e":172.33},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":172.36,"e":174.44},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":174.55,"e":176.51},{"t":"Love does not delight in flame.","s":176.6,"e":178.94},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":178.99,"e":182.9},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":183.01,"e":184.89},{"t":"Yet still I am the same.","s":184.99,"e":189.77},{"t":"As they bruise Me and spit in My face,","s":189.79,"e":194.07},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":194.18,"e":198.11},{"t":"As they pierce My side,","s":198.19,"e":200.76},{"t":"blood and tears run down together.","s":200.85,"e":206.53},{"t":"As My own people drive in the nails,","s":206.59,"e":209.88},{"t":"I am lifted from My place,","s":209.92,"e":215.36},{"t":"arms spread apart, waiting still","s":215.46,"e":218.86},{"t":"to receive them in embrace.","s":218.98,"e":223.05},{"t":"Oh My people… why?","s":223.14,"e":226.48},{"t":"why have you forsaken Me?","s":226.55,"e":231.38},{"t":"You forsake Me.","s":231.46,"e":233.46},{"t":"You forsake Me.","s":233.54,"e":235.63},{"t":"Forsake Me?","s":235.73,"e":241.54},{"t":"Me?","s":241.65,"e":243.61},{"t":"Why forsake Me?","s":243.71,"e":251.67},{"t":"Why forsake Me?","s":251.77,"e":256.71},{"t":"This sorrow will not rise again.","s":256.73,"e":260.44},{"t":"This ruin must not remain.","s":260.54,"e":265.07},{"t":"Love will purge what love must purge","s":265.16,"e":269.12},{"t":"Death can not reign.","s":269.22,"e":272.45},{"t":"I take no pleasure in what must be done ,","s":272.55,"e":277.14},{"t":"no pleasure at all.","s":277.24,"e":281.66},{"t":"Evil will not toil forever.","s":281.76,"e":284.36},{"t":"Our tears will cease to fall.","s":284.44,"e":292.99},{"t":"fall","s":293.09,"e":296.97},{"t":"fall","s":297.07,"e":301.36},{"t":"fall","s":301.46,"e":305.28},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":305.29,"e":307.21},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":307.31,"e":309.28},{"t":"But not for endless years.","s":309.38,"e":313.59},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":313.7,"e":315.74},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":315.85,"e":317.53},{"t":"Purging sorrows and fears.","s":317.59,"e":322.53},{"t":"I am come down.","s":322.54,"e":326.19},{"t":"Not divided in My heart.","s":326.29,"e":331.77},{"t":"Love that bled for you","s":331.87,"e":334.15},{"t":"now takes man's kingdoms apart.","s":334.23,"e":339.07},{"t":"I AM.","s":339.18,"e":347.19},{"t":"I AM.","s":347.31,"e":351.34},{"t":"I AM come down!","s":351.46,"e":353.63},{"t":"down","s":353.73,"e":354.49},{"t":"down","s":354.59,"e":359.36},{"t":"down","s":359.45,"e":359.92}],"match":null}
